{
  "uid": "suntzu-rc-logs",
  "title": "SunTzu RC · 4 Logs",
  "description": "Errores, peticiones por bit, las últimas líneas de cada servicio y las ejecuciones de las tareas programadas.",
  "tags": ["suntzu-rc"],
  "editable": true,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "5m",
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": ["5m", "15m", "30m", "1h"]
  },
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "SunTzu RC",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": ["suntzu-rc"],
      "asDropdown": false,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Logs: ¿qué pasó?\nLas líneas que escriben la web, la API y las tareas programadas, guardadas 30 días. Por defecto, **las últimas 24 h**: amplía el rango arriba a la derecha hasta 30 días. Cada consulta cobra por GB leído (0,005 USD); hoy todos los logs juntos no llegan a 1 MB."
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Errores",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errores en el tiempo",
      "description": "Líneas con level error o fatal de la web y la API, cada 15 min. Vacío = ningún error en el rango elegido.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/app",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/app"
            },
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/app", "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api"],
          "expression": "filter level = \"error\" or level = \"fatal\"\n| stats count(*) as errores by bin(15m)",
          "statsGroups": [],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Errores agrupados por mensaje",
      "description": "Si hay uno con muchas repeticiones es un solo problema; si son muchos distintos, varios.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/app",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/app"
            },
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/app", "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api"],
          "expression": "filter level = \"error\" or level = \"fatal\"\n| stats count(*) as veces, latest(@timestamp) as ultima by @log, message\n| sort veces desc\n| limit 25",
          "statsGroups": [],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Peticiones a la API",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Por bit y respuesta",
      "description": "Cada fila es una acción de la API (el bit, ver docs/bits) con su código de respuesta y lo que tardó (ms, medido por la propia API).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api"],
          "expression": "filter context = \"Http\"\n| stats count(*) as peticiones, avg(message.ms) as media_ms, pct(message.ms, 95) as p95_ms, max(message.ms) as max_ms by message.bit as bit, message.status as estado\n| sort peticiones desc\n| limit 40",
          "statsGroups": [],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 10
      },
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Peticiones por respuesta",
      "description": "Las mismas peticiones, en el tiempo, por código de respuesta.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api"],
          "expression": "filter context = \"Http\"\n| stats count(*) as peticiones by bin(15m), message.status as estado",
          "statsGroups": ["estado"],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "gradientMode": "opacity",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "off"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 13,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 10
      },
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Últimas líneas",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 8
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "API",
      "description": "Las últimas 200 líneas. Pulsa una para ver todos sus campos, también el trace_id para buscarla en Trazas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/api"],
          "expression": "fields @timestamp, @message, @logStream\n| sort @timestamp desc\n| limit 200",
          "statsGroups": [],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "prettifyLogMessage": false
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 12
      },
      "id": 9
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Web",
      "description": "Las últimas 200 líneas del servidor de Next.js. Next.js casi solo escribe al arrancar (cada despliegue o reinicio) y cuando algo falla: si está vacío en 24 h, amplía el rango.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/app",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/app"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": ["/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/app"],
          "expression": "fields @timestamp, @message, @logStream\n| sort @timestamp desc\n| limit 200",
          "statsGroups": [],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "prettifyLogMessage": false
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 12
      },
      "id": 10
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Tareas programadas",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 11
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Ejecuciones",
      "description": "Cada fila es una ejecución (un contenedor, un stream de logs): cuándo empezó, su última línea y cuántas líneas mencionan un error. engine: 05, 11, 17 y 23 h UTC · notify: cada hora a y 15 · census: el día 2 de cada mes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/engine",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/engine"
            },
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/notify",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/notify"
            },
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/census",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/census"
            },
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/setup",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/setup"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": [
            "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/engine",
            "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/notify",
            "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/census",
            "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/setup"
          ],
          "expression": "fields @logStream\n| parse @logStream \"*/*/*\" as tarea, contenedor, ejecucion\n| stats min(@timestamp) as empieza, max(@timestamp) as termina, count(*) as lineas, sum(strcontains(tolower(@message), \"error\")) as con_error by tarea, ejecucion\n| sort empieza desc\n| limit 40",
          "statsGroups": [],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 14,
        "h": 12
      },
      "id": 12
    },
    {
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Últimas líneas de las tareas",
      "description": "Lo que dijo cada tarea en su última ejecución (texto plano).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "cloudwatch",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "queryMode": "Logs",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "logGroups": [
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/engine",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/engine"
            },
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/notify",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/notify"
            },
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/census",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/census"
            },
            {
              "arn": "arn:aws:logs:us-east-2:352587389937:log-group:/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/setup",
              "name": "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/setup"
            }
          ],
          "logGroupNames": [
            "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/engine",
            "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/notify",
            "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/census",
            "/ecs/rc-landing-${env}/setup"
          ],
          "expression": "fields @timestamp, @message, @logStream\n| sort @timestamp desc\n| limit 200",
          "statsGroups": [],
          "queryLanguage": "CWLI",
          "id": "",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "prettifyLogMessage": false
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 14,
        "y": 37,
        "w": 10,
        "h": 12
      },
      "id": 13
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "cloudwatch",
        "regex": "/SunTzu/",
        "hide": 2,
        "current": {},
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Entorno",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "staging",
        "current": {
          "text": "staging",
          "value": "staging"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "staging",
            "value": "staging",
            "selected": true
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "lb",
        "label": "lb",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "cloudwatch",
          "uid": "${ds}"
        },
        "hide": 2,
        "query": {
          "refId": "Var",
          "queryType": "dimensionValues",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "namespace": "AWS/ApplicationELB",
          "metricName": "RequestCount",
          "dimensionKey": "LoadBalancer",
          "dimensionFilters": {}
        },
        "regex": "/^app\\/rc-landing-${env}\\/.*/",
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {},
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "tg_app",
        "label": "tg_app",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "cloudwatch",
          "uid": "${ds}"
        },
        "hide": 2,
        "query": {
          "refId": "Var",
          "queryType": "dimensionValues",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "namespace": "AWS/ApplicationELB",
          "metricName": "RequestCount",
          "dimensionKey": "TargetGroup",
          "dimensionFilters": {}
        },
        "regex": "/^targetgroup\\/rc-landing-${env}-app\\/.*/",
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {},
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "tg_api",
        "label": "tg_api",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "cloudwatch",
          "uid": "${ds}"
        },
        "hide": 2,
        "query": {
          "refId": "Var",
          "queryType": "dimensionValues",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "namespace": "AWS/ApplicationELB",
          "metricName": "RequestCount",
          "dimensionKey": "TargetGroup",
          "dimensionFilters": {}
        },
        "regex": "/^targetgroup\\/rc-landing-${env}-api\\/.*/",
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {},
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "db",
        "label": "db",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "cloudwatch",
          "uid": "${ds}"
        },
        "hide": 2,
        "query": {
          "refId": "Var",
          "queryType": "dimensionValues",
          "region": "us-east-2",
          "namespace": "AWS/RDS",
          "metricName": "CPUUtilization",
          "dimensionKey": "DBInstanceIdentifier",
          "dimensionFilters": {}
        },
        "regex": "/^rc-landing-${env}-.*/",
        "refresh": 1,
        "sort": 1,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "current": {},
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "hc_app",
        "label": "hc_app",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "cloudwatch",
          "uid": "${ds}"
        },
        "hide": 2,
        "query": {
          "refId": "Var",
          "queryType": "resourceARNs",
